#. the plugin's name (a brand); usually kept as it is.
#: main.ts:252 manifest.json panel.ts:55 youtube.slint:8
msgid "VestraTube"
msgstr "VestraTube"

#: main.ts:259
msgid "YouTube Link…"
msgstr "YouTube 链接…"

#: manifest.json
msgid "Search YouTube in the sidebar and play videos right away"
msgstr "在侧栏搜索 YouTube，即点即播"

#: manifest.json
msgid "A YouTube sidebar for Vestra Player: search, see thumbnails, titles, durations and channels, and play a video with a double-click. Download videos as MKV files, or play and download a single video from its link. No sign-in and nothing to install: the YouTube part uses the bundled open-source library youtubei.js, downloads use the player's own ffmpeg."
msgstr "Vestra Player 的 YouTube 侧栏：搜索视频，查看缩略图、标题、时长和频道，双击即可播放。可将视频下载为 MKV 文件，也可以通过链接播放或下载单个视频。无需登录、无需安装任何程序：YouTube 部分使用内置的开源库 youtubei.js，下载使用播放器自带的 ffmpeg。"

#: manifest.json
msgid "online video"
msgstr "网络视频"

#: manifest.json
msgid "YouTube"
msgstr "YouTube"

#: manifest.json
msgid "download"
msgstr "下载"

